":0,"stats":[56,31,68,69,49,43],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[56,31,68,69,49,43],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[56,31,68,69,49,43],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1035","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[56,31,68,69,49,43],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[56,31,68,69,49,43],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"97","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"三国时期曹魏官员，名将臧霸之子。年少以才理知名，起家黄门郎，历任郡守。臧霸死后承袭良成侯爵位。为谋求显贵官职，巴结掌选举的邓飏，将父亲臧霸的爱妾赠予对方，此事传遍洛阳，广受士林讥讽。官至青州刺史，后入朝升任少府（九卿），死后谥号恭侯，子臧权继嗣。","tc":"三國時期曹魏官員，名將臧霸之子。年少以才理知名，起家黃門郎，歷任郡守。臧霸死后承襲良成侯爵位。為謀求顯貴官職，巴結掌選舉的鄧飏，將父親臧霸的愛妾贈予對方，此事傳遍洛陽，廣受士林譏諷。官至青州刺史，后入朝升任少府（九卿），死后謚號恭侯，子臧權繼嗣。","en":"An official of Cao Wei during the Three Kingdoms period and the son of the famous general Zang Ba. Renowned for his talent and intellect in his youth, he began his career as a Gentleman at the Yellow Gates and successively served as Commandery Governor. After Zang Ba's death, he inherited the title of Marquis of Liangcheng. Seeking high office, he curried favor with Deng Yang, who oversaw official appointments, by presenting him with his father Zang Ba's beloved concubine. This incident became widely known across Luoyang and drew widespread mockery from the scholar-gentry. He eventually rose to Inspector of Qing Province and later entered the imperial court as Chamberlain for the Palace Revenues (one of the Nine Ministers). After his death, he was posthumously titled Marquis Gong, and his son Zang Quan succeeded his title.","jp":"三国時代の曹魏の官吏で、名将・臧覇の子。若くして才理で知られ、黄門郎に起家し、郡守を歴任した。臧覇の死後は良成侯の爵位を継いだ。顕職を求めるあまり、人事（選挙）を司る鄧颺に阿り、父の愛妾を鄧颺に贈ったため、その件は洛陽中に知れ渡り、士林から大いに譏られた。官位は青州刺史に至り、後に入朝して少府（九卿）に昇進した。没後は恭侯と諡され、子の臧権が後を継いだ。","kr":"삼국시대 조위의 관료이자 명장 장패의 아들이다. 젊어서부터 재능과 식견으로 널리 알려졌으며, 황문랑으로 벼슬길에 올라 여러 군의 태수를 역임했다. 장패가 세상을 떠난 후에는 양성후의 작위를 계승했다. 영달을 꾀하고자 관리 천거를 관장하던 등양에게 아부하며 아버지 장패의 애첩을 바치기도 했는데, 이 일이 낙양에 널리 퍼져 사림의 큰 비웃음을 샀다. 관직은 청주자사에 이르렀고, 이후 입조하여 소부(구경)로 승진했다. 사후에 공후(恭侯)의 시호를 받았으며, 아들 장권이 뒤를 이었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1033615","remark":"","surname":"臧","surnameTc":"臧","surnameEn":"Zang","surnameJp":"臧","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"艾","nameTc":"艾","nameEn":"Ai","nameJp":"艾","nameKr":"애","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"臧艾","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"219","city":"CS1035","gender":"0","rule":"56","force":"31","wise":"68","politics":"69","charm":"49","will":"43","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"4","willT